{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/b4d5cc3feaa3723fd69b63286d585b4b.poster.avif?t=1766514630\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/b4d5cc3feaa3723fd69b63286d585b4b.webm?t=1766514630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/b4d5cc3feaa3723fd69b63286d585b4b.mp4?t=1766514630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight endless waves of monsters, protect your Mech Spider, and mine resources in Ocean Keeper, a survival co-op roguelike. Play as one of four miners, upgrade your gear and Mech, and explore underwater dungeons. Face the ocean\u2019s dangers and do whatever it takes to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/d269ed363bba81302b76bc0e7afeb112.webp?t=1766514630\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/9ff4c42e41e3cc0bcf8a68b645356600.poster.avif?t=1766514630\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/9ff4c42e41e3cc0bcf8a68b645356600.webm?t=1766514630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/9ff4c42e41e3cc0bcf8a68b645356600.mp4?t=1766514630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends and climb into the Mech Spider to kill thousands of monsters. Work as a team to protect your Mech \u2013 if it goes down, your crew will be defenseless against hordes of creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/2c1a6b4be7c021a8b7db67e1080074d9.webp?t=1766514630\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/ce9879f3c56e386bfa26924a55abf13c.poster.avif?t=1766514630\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/ce9879f3c56e386bfa26924a55abf13c.webm?t=1766514630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/ce9879f3c56e386bfa26924a55abf13c.mp4?t=1766514630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a rest from endless battles and explore the caves in search of valuable resources and rare artifacts. But don\u2019t get too comfortable \u2013 your team has just one minute to mine, upgrade your gear, and get ready for the next wave. If you are brave enough,\u00a0 you might find something truly powerful\u2026 just in time to face the bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/01d0cdd4bd49c079c3cdbdaedb9094b3.webp?t=1766514630\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/4dfaba343bf451d7e5387f1467eec6aa.poster.avif?t=1766514630\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/4dfaba343bf451d7e5387f1467eec6aa.webm?t=1766514630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/4dfaba343bf451d7e5387f1467eec6aa.mp4?t=1766514630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine resources from the ocean depths to unlock and upgrade powerful gear. Choose from 9 unique weapons \u2013 each with its own range, strengths, and playstyle. Don\u2019t forget to coordinate with your team and plan your loadout beforehand: strategic positioning is key to protecting your Mech and surviving the endless waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/e3873414928f13f10f2e35b4727c6887.webp?t=1766514630\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/9b9a46bcaca32913712e5dd671ae7c02.poster.avif?t=1766514630\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/9b9a46bcaca32913712e5dd671ae7c02.webm?t=1766514630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/9b9a46bcaca32913712e5dd671ae7c02.mp4?t=1766514630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ocean Keeper, no two waves are ever the same. Each brings new challenges, enemies, and opportunities for your team to adapt, strategize, and survive various underwater adventures. Upgrade your gear differently every time, uncover rare relics, and battle frightening bosses \u2013 you will never experience any run twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So gear up, dive deep, and may your Mech legs never rust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, survival miners \u2013 the ocean is waiting.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/2ebbda82bdce7ba75632bc684f37ae35.avif?t=1766514630\" width=1560 height=2266 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937360?t=1766514630","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/e77af0e6ada013267412876a054d926487c31f43/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766514630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/848d21fd49b04d1abe9859f0d75e89fd5356ff6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766514630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/848d21fd49b04d1abe9859f0d75e89fd5356ff6f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766514630","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Early Access Soon</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/88577c0a28026ae22507465ded9bcb83.avif?t=1766514630\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/b4d5cc3feaa3723fd69b63286d585b4b.poster.avif?t=1766514630\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937360/extras/b4d5cc3f